              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "MK!"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was good. It was very sweet - so I would like it more for a snack than with dinner. I made my own chutney so only added \"regular\" chuntey and no \"hot\" chutney (my mom doesn't do spicy). I would like a little more quinoa for the amount of \"mix-ins\". Definitely a nice recipe though!!!"
